    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AMERICAN\nAIRLINES\nSystem Map\nN303AA\nAMERICAN\nAmericas Leading Airline",
      "AMERICAN MAKES HISTORY\nWITH THE\nFirst Nonstop Service\nCoast To Coast\nIN BOTH DIRECTIONS\nNEW YORK\nLOS ANGELES\nAmerican's new DC-7 Flagship will fly you cross-\ncountry in under 8 hours. This unmatched travel\ntime is made possible by the 365 mph cruising\nspeed of the fastest piston-powered transport in\nthe world. With the new DC-7, American con-\ntinues to set the standard for service in trans-\ncontinental travel.\nThe DC-7 features many new developments de-\nsigned for your comfort-special soundproofing,\neven more comfortable seats, and air condition-\ning on the ground as well as in the air. Twenty-\nfive DC-7 Flagships will be added to the Fleet\nby mid 1954. This means more nonstop transcon-\ntinental service and the introduction of this supe-\nrior plane to other cities throughout the nation.\nAMERICAN AIRLINES INC.\nAmericas Leading Airline\n19941.25\n.06\nLithographed in U.S.A:\nT-197E 254 450M",
